 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? I usually carry about two and a half to three liters of water, enough for about three hours. Plenty of people do. Water bottles with handles are great, you can keep one in your handlebar bag and grab it whenever you need it. If you' going to be on the bike for more than couple of hours, yes. A bar with something sweet and something salty keeps your energy up. Lots of people do, but I like having something solid at the start. And if you stop for coffee, you' have something to eat and grab.",
